Error: Jet.GrammarEmptyRepeat: This repeat's item can match nothing, so the repeat would never stop
  --> Tests/UI/grammar_empty_repeat.jet:5:27
    |
  5 |     names : (items+=NAME?)* ;
    |                           ^
 Why: A repeat goes on while its item matches, and an item that matches no text matches forever
 Fix: Make the repeated item match at least one token, or make it required and drop its `?`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.GrammarEmptyRepeat
